WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:02.735 --> 00:00:05.038
- IT'S SO RICH
IN HISTORY.

00:00:05.071 --> 00:00:06.773
- I GREW UP IN A NEIGHBORHOOD
LIKE THIS.

00:00:06.806 --> 00:00:08.074
- OH, YEAH, I GREW UP
IN A NEIGHBORHOOD

00:00:08.107 --> 00:00:10.810
EXACTLY LIKE THIS.

00:00:10.843 --> 00:00:12.178
- ALL RIGHT,
WELCOME TO MAMA SUGARBACK'S.

00:00:12.211 --> 00:00:14.647
Y'ALL READY TO ORDER?
- YEAH.

00:00:14.680 --> 00:00:18.351
CAN I HAVE A CHICKEN FRIED STEAK
WITH GRAVY AND A COLA?

00:00:18.384 --> 00:00:20.553
- OKAY.

00:00:20.586 --> 00:00:22.522
- I WILL HAVE THE BAKED BEEF
SHORT RIBS WITH COLLARD GREENS,

00:00:22.555 --> 00:00:23.823
AND THROW DOWN
SOME OF THAT CORNBREAD.

00:00:23.856 --> 00:00:26.692
- ALL RIGHT, BABE.

00:00:26.725 --> 00:00:28.961
- YOU KNOW WHAT?
HOLD UP A SECOND.

00:00:28.994 --> 00:00:30.463
I'M ALSO GONNA HAVE
SOME OF THEM

00:00:30.496 --> 00:00:32.598
COLLARD GREENS AND CORNBREAD
AS WELL,

00:00:32.631 --> 00:00:33.900
BUT HOOK A BROTHER UP
WITH SOME OF THEM HOT LINKS.

00:00:33.933 --> 00:00:36.035
- ALL RIGHT.
- ALL RIGHT.

00:00:36.068 --> 00:00:39.739
- [chuckles] YOU KNOW WHAT?
WHY AM I TRYING TO FRONT?

00:00:39.772 --> 00:00:41.474
SCRATCH ALL THAT.

00:00:41.507 --> 00:00:44.577
GIVE ME SOME OKRA
AND SOME FRIED RED SNAPPER.

00:00:44.610 --> 00:00:45.745
AND GIRL, YOU KNOW I WANT
SOME CHITLINS.

00:00:45.778 --> 00:00:47.713
- ALL RIGHT NOW.

00:00:47.746 --> 00:00:50.016
- Y'ALL GOT HAM HOCKS?

00:00:50.049 --> 00:00:52.018
- OF COURSE.
- WELL, THAT'S WHAT I WANT.

00:00:52.051 --> 00:00:54.454
I WANT A PLATE OF HAM HOCKS,
DEEP-FRIED, BLACKENED,

00:00:54.487 --> 00:00:55.588
AND SERVED ON A BED
OF MUSTARD GREENS.

00:00:55.621 --> 00:00:57.256
- PIG FEET.

00:00:57.289 --> 00:01:01.127
I WANT SOME PIG FEET
AND FOUR POUNDS OF GRITS.

00:01:01.160 --> 00:01:02.895
AND OH, OH!
AND YOU KNOW WHAT ELSE?

00:01:02.928 --> 00:01:05.098
GIVE ME A LITTLE DIXIE CUP
FULL OF LARD, ALL RIGHT?

00:01:05.131 --> 00:01:08.034
- I JUST REMEMBERED WHAT I WANT.
A BOWL OF MOSQUITOES.

00:01:08.067 --> 00:01:10.570
NONE OF THEM TINY ONES EITHER,
GIVE ME THEM BIG MOTHER[bleep]

00:01:10.603 --> 00:01:12.805
YOU FIND
DOWN AT THE SWAMPS.

00:01:12.838 --> 00:01:15.475
- SISTER, COULD YOU PLEASE
HOOK A BROTHER UP

00:01:15.508 --> 00:01:17.376
WITH A RUSTY BUCKET
FULL OF FISH HEADS

00:01:17.409 --> 00:01:19.545
WRAPPED IN RAZOR WIRE?

00:01:19.578 --> 00:01:21.147
- DONKEY TEETH.
- DONKEY TEETH?

00:01:21.180 --> 00:01:23.149
- STRAIGHT OUT
A DONKEY'S MOUTH.

00:01:23.182 --> 00:01:25.952
YOU KNOW WHAT? [bleep] IT.
ANY ANIMAL TOOTH WILL DO.

00:01:25.985 --> 00:01:27.320
I WANT YOU TO STICK IT
IN SOME HONEY GLAZE,

00:01:27.353 --> 00:01:28.855
FRY IT WITH FAT BACK,

00:01:28.888 --> 00:01:30.656
AND SERVE IT
IN AN OLD TIN COFFEE CAN.

00:01:30.689 --> 00:01:32.592
- FORGET EVERYTHING I SAID
UP TO THIS POINT RIGHT NOW.

00:01:32.625 --> 00:01:35.328
BRING ME SOME DANDELION GREENS,
A COW HIP, AND A DOG FACE.

00:01:35.361 --> 00:01:37.463
WRAP THAT WHOLE MESS
IN AN OLD<i> EBONY</i> MAGAZINE,

00:01:37.496 --> 00:01:39.031
AND SERVE IT TO ME
IN A SHOEBOX.

00:01:39.064 --> 00:01:41.067
- OKAY, I WANT A PLATTER
OF STORK ANKLES,

00:01:41.100 --> 00:01:43.736
AN OLD CELLAR DOOR,
A POSSUM SPINE,

00:01:43.769 --> 00:01:47.273
AND A HUMAN FOOT.

00:01:51.844 --> 00:01:54.714
- YOU WANT A HUMAN FOOT?

00:01:54.747 --> 00:01:58.117
- MM-HMM.

00:01:58.150 --> 00:02:01.721
- I GOT JUST ONE QUESTION
FOR Y'ALL.

00:02:05.157 --> 00:02:07.026
- YOU WANT GRAVY
ON THAT CELLAR DOOR?

00:02:07.059 --> 00:02:08.728
- OH, DEFINITELY.

00:02:08.761 --> 00:02:10.229
- OH, YEAH, YEAH.
YOU GOTTA PUT GRAVY ON THAT.

00:02:10.262 --> 00:02:11.430
- WHAT'S A CELLAR DOOR
WITHOUT GRAVY?

00:02:11.463 --> 00:02:13.333
- IT'S NOT FOOD.

00:02:18.637 --> 00:02:21.741
- MMM.

00:02:21.774 --> 00:02:23.843
- IT'S REALLY--
[chokes]

00:02:23.876 --> 00:02:24.876
- UGH.

